<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylinco buys stake in broker CBC Crosby.</title>
<headline>Ceylinco buys stake in broker CBC Crosby.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceylinco Securities &amp; Financial Services Ltd said on Monday it had bought a controlling interest in CBC Crosby Stock Brokers (Pvt) Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;The name of the company will be changed to Ceylinco Stock Brokers Ltd, subject to the approval of the registrar of companies,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>CBC Crosby Stock Brokers (Pvt) Ltd had operated in Colombo since July 1995, in a tie-up with Commercial Stock Brokers.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
